        "status": "Contact Oleg Drokin (green@whamcloud.com) with any questions on this account"
      },
      "date": "2026-11-18 22:25:23.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 6:\n\n(4 comments)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nLooks good. The reader stayed inside a guard-paged slot under several million random corruptions, and libcapnp 2.2.4 decodes what the writer produces (records with skipped entries, skipped-only chunks, empty non-null values). There are a few optional items inline for whenever this is next refreshed, and none of them needs a re-spin.",
      "accounts_in_message": [],
      "_revision_number": 6
    },
