        "username": "hnishida",
        "status": "The Lustre Collective"
      },
      "date": "2026-11-18 22:46:20.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 6:\n\nPS6 spends most of the spare room in struct llapi_scan_inode on ino and the nanoseconds, so one more 64-bit field changes its size again. Since it is 2.18 ABI, could li_spare[] grow now, or llapi_scan_chunk_inode() take sizeof(*li)?",
      "accounts_in_message": [],
      "_revision_number": 6
    },
